{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X部分段落的感受词仍然偏密，个别相近的比喻连续出现，Y的叙述句整体更连贯，主线阅读负担更小。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的优势不只是信息更多，而是视觉层级更明确：放大的关键词能让人迅速抓住每段心理变化，较小的感受文字和按乐段出现的提示又能把注意力带回音乐。它把人物的矛盾拆成了连续的小变化，让人不仅知道他舍不得什么、害怕什么，也能理解为什么他一会儿想回去、一会儿又不愿回去，最后怎样逐渐找到自己的立场。Y的叙述更顺畅简洁，但不少音乐感受被压缩成概括性短词，人物心理转折和音乐细节之间的对应关系也没有X那么充分。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b6f55df4-7fc0-4977-b8c0-23bb17c3dff9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T182002340442Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:21:24.221063+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8d20e48484ffdc316bdcfdbf94193259ef9e26fdabf01422198f93d256999669", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch